# Generated artifacts
*.pdf
# ...but PDFs under docs/ are content, not artifacts -- including archived ones.
# Without these, `git mv` into docs/archive/ reads as a plain deletion and the file
# stops travelling with the clone.
!docs/*.pdf
!docs/archive/*.pdf
